      "side": 1,
      "message": "page_to_balloon_pfn() calculates `(address \u003e\u003e PAGE_SHIFT)` (which is 12 for 4k).\n\nIn this patch, we might be allocating hugepages, for which we have to do the following to get the start of the PFN for the hugepage: `(address \u003e\u003e PAGE_SHIFT) \u003e\u003e hugepage_order`.\n\nWe don\u0027t send unshifted addresses, it\u0027s double shifted so that the device can construct the GPA from the hugepage PFN correctly.",
